## Interface: 16001
## Title: Patchwerk Forever: Thread (Immersive Plainsrunning)
## Notes: For Tauren: as Plainsrunning stacks up, the interface fades away until only the world is left, then speed streaks (and wind, dust, rings or a glow, as you choose) rush past the screen. It all comes back the moment the run ends, a fight starts or you open a window. Needs Patchwerk Forever. Type /plains.
